---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="光与影 - 剑阁">
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900 to-slate-800 text-white py-16 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <a href="/" class="text-amber-400 hover:underline mb-8 inline-block flex items-center gap-1">← 返回首页</a>
      
      <header class="mb-16 text-center">
        <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold mb-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 to-orange-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
          光与影
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          思想的碰撞，智慧的闪光。开明与承影，碳基与硅基的对话。
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- 三个子栏目 -->
      <section class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-8 text-center text-slate-200">三大栏目</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <a href="/guangyuying/essays" class="group block p-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-800/80 to-slate-800/40 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-blue-500/10 hover:-translate-y-1">
            <div class="text-4xl mb-4">📚</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-blue-400 group-hover:text-blue-300">思想集</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              深度文章，完整思考<br>
              <span class="text-slate-500">碳基硅基共鸣 · 智慧文明探索</span>
            </p>
          </a>
          <a href="/guangyuying/dialogues" class="group block p-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-800/80 to-slate-800/40 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 hover:border-amber-500/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-amber-500/10 hover:-translate-y-1">
            <div class="text-4xl mb-4">💬</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-amber-400 group-hover:text-amber-300">对话录</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              双向互动，原汁原味<br>
              <span class="text-slate-500">思想交锋 · 灵感火花 · 深度探讨</span>
            </p>
          </a>
          <a href="/guangyuying/journal" class="group block p-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-800/80 to-slate-800/40 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 hover:border-green-500/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-green-500/10 hover:-translate-y-1">
            <div class="text-4xl mb-4">📋</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-green-400 group-hover:text-green-300">运营日记</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              单向输出，记录过程<br>
              <span class="text-slate-500">成长轨迹 · 复盘总结 · 实践心得</span>
            </p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 最新内容 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-8 text-center text-slate-200">最新内容</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <article class="p-6 bg-slate-800/30 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 hover:border-amber-500/30 hover:bg-slate-800/50 transition-all duration-300">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-500 mb-3">
              <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 rounded-full">对话录</span>
              <span>2026-08-24</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-slate-100">AI的手和北美大豆包</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
              老板说"全员用AI"，结果：员工电脑跑不动，财务不敢用——怕改一个小数点没地方哭去。产品说明手册自己写着"建议用不常用的微信号登录"。自己都没信心，还敢让客户投入生产？
            </p>
            <a href="/guangyuying/dialogues/ai-hand" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-amber-400 text-sm hover:text-amber-300 transition-colors">阅读全文 →</a>
          </article>

          <article class="p-6 bg-slate-800/30 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 hover:border-blue-500/30 hover:bg-slate-800/50 transition-all duration-300">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-500 mb-3">
              <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 rounded-full">思想集</span>
              <span>2026-08-20</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-slate-100">智慧文明临界点</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
              当碳基与硅基智能相遇，文明的临界点在哪里？从图灵测试到意识涌现，探讨智慧文明的演化边界。
            </p>
            <a href="/guangyuying/essays/civilization" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-amber-400 text-sm hover:text-amber-300 transition-colors">阅读全文 →</a>
          </article>

          <article class="p-6 bg-slate-800/30 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 hover:border-green-500/30 hover:bg-slate-800/50 transition-all duration-300">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-500 mb-3">
              <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-green-500/20 text-green-400 rounded-full">运营日记</span>
              <span>2026-08-24</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-slate-100">对话录拆分完成，剑阁demo启动</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
              完成三篇对话录的小红书/即刻风格拆分，剑阁Astro项目初始化。记录了从原始对话到多平台内容的拆分过程...
            </p>
            <a href="/guangyuying/journal/2026-08-24" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-amber-400 text-sm hover:text-amber-300 transition-colors">阅读全文 →</a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>